@startuml sequence-contact-support
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
title Sequence — Contact support (UC7)
actor Customer
boundary ":WebApp" as Web
participant "phone / mail app\n(customer's device)" as Device

Customer -> Web : openSupport()
Web --> Customer : contact panel — phone, e-mail,\noffice hours
note right of Web
  Purely in the browser —
  no call to the backend
end note

opt click the phone number or the e-mail
  Customer -> Web : click tel: / mailto: link
  Web -> Device : open the link
  Device --> Customer : phone / mail app opens
end

Customer -> Web : close the panel
@enduml
